.el .ds Aq '
.TH swarm-status 1  "swarm 0.2.2" "Swarmgit manual"
.SH NAME
swarm\-status \- Show the daemon, repos, relays and peers
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBswarm status\fR [\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fIREPO\fR] [\fIsubcommands\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Show the daemon, repos, relays and peers
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Print one JSON object on stdout
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
[\fIREPO\fR]
Show one repo in detail
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
swarm\-status\-repos(1)
Repositories: sequence numbers, seeders and conflicts
.TP
swarm\-status\-relays(1)
Relay registrations
.TP
swarm\-status\-peers(1)
Peers known for each repo, and which are connected
